Open Vanilla 0013: leveling pace on the world server (faster flights, flight paths by level, campfire
rest, Veteran Mentor quest XP, level-scaled exploration XP, starter items back on abandon when they cannot be farmed), the
capital training dummies, and the realm's real numbers for the client's tooltips (PZ line, the
Hearthstone cooldown cleared when it ends, quest XP in the QM line). Every OpenVanilla.Pace.*
switch is off unless mangosd.conf sets it; see src/game/OpenVanilla/Pace.h.
World data: realm/classicplus/classicplus_pace.sql.

